## Title: Add-On Memory Watch
## Description: Finds the add-on that is filling your add-on memory or throwing errors. It records how much memory each add-on uses as it loads, estimates how much data each one holds (every 5 minutes, spread out so it doesn't stutter), shows each add-on's saved data size, logs which add-on every error came from, and keeps a record of the session before the game turns add-ons off. Open it from Settings > Add-Ons > Add-On Memory Watch (needs LibHarvensAddonSettings). Find it useful? Gold donations by in-game mail to @DextrousDigits (Xbox NA or EU) are very welcome.
## Author: ESO Companion
